    <bpmn:process id="W_W5476" name="W5476. Green Fleet Telematics, Eco-Driving &amp; Driver Behavior Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vehicles in service; driver behavior program
Frequency: Continuous telematics; weekly/monthly driver review
Volume: Per driver × per EV/alt-fuel vehicle
Owner: Fleet Operations Manager (VS-06.2)
Participants: Drivers, HR/L&amp;D (VS-19.4), Telematics vendor, HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W5476 — Green Fleet Telematics, Eco-Driving &amp; Driver Behavior Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5476_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5476_Lane1" name="Telematics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5476_Lane2" name="Fleet Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5476_Lane3" name="Fleet Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5476_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5476_Start5" name="Vehicles in service; driver behavior program">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5476_Task6" name="Configure telematics (links VS-06 W199) to capture EV-relevant behavior: harsh…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Configure telematics (links VS-06 W199) to capture EV-relevant behavior: harsh acceleration/braking (which drains battery and degrades range), over-speed, idling (for hybrids), cabin-pre-conditioning abuse, and eco-mode adherence.
Responsible (R): Telematics / Fleet Ops
Accountable (A): Fleet Operations Manager
Duration: per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5476_Task7" name="Generate per-driver and per-vehicle eco-driving scores; benchmark kWh/km (EV)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Generate per-driver and per-vehicle eco-driving scores; benchmark kWh/km (EV) and L/100km (hybrid/alt-fuel) against the route baseline (W5472).
Responsible (R): Fleet Analyst
Accountable (A): Fleet Operations Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5476_Task8" name="Coach under-performing drivers (links VS-124/VS-19.4 enablement) and recognize…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coach under-performing drivers (links VS-124/VS-19.4 enablement) and recognize top performers; feed serious/safety behaviors (speeding, harsh events) into the safety program (W5483) and driver standards (VS-06.2).
Responsible (R): Fleet Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Fleet Operations Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5476_Task9" name="Quantify the kWh/L savings from eco-driving and feed it into the TCO/benefit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quantify the kWh/L savings from eco-driving and feed it into the TCO/benefit tracking (W5488) and the driver-incentive program.
Responsible (R): Fleet Analyst
Accountable (A): Fleet Operations Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5476_Task10" name="Maintain telematics data quality and privacy (driver-behavior data is personal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Maintain telematics data quality and privacy (driver-behavior data is personal data under RA 10173 — links VS-91) and a documented driver-contest/grievance path.
Responsible (R): Fleet Ops / DPO (VS-91)
Accountable (A): Fleet Operations Manager
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5476_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5476_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5476_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
