        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-807 (ensure controlled execution — EV / Alt-Fuel Fleet Operations, Charging &amp; Energy Management (PA-192.2).) | - operational: documented driver-contest/grievance path; coaching threshold policy.
Owner: Fleet Operations Manager (VS-06.2)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
