    <bpmn:process id="W_W5477" name="W5477. Range-Aware Route Dispatch, Payload Optimization &amp; Charging-Stop Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily dispatch; network re-design (W5472); SoH updates (W5475)
Frequency: Daily, per vehicle and per route
Volume: Per EV/alt-fuel dispatch across 4 DCs + last-mile + jobsite
Owner: Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06.1/VS-06.3)
Participants: Drivers, Network Planning (W5472), Charging Ops (W5473), Store Ops (VS-177)
Source: workflow W5477 — Range-Aware Route Dispatch, Payload Optimization &amp; Charging-Stop Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5477_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5477_Lane1" name="Dispatcher">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5477_Lane2" name="Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5477_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5477_Start4" name="Daily dispatch; network re-design (W5472); SoH updates (W5475)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5477_Task5" name="Assign vehicles to dispatches matching usable range (from SoH W5475) to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assign vehicles to dispatches matching usable range (from SoH W5475) to the route&#x27;s energy requirement (distance, payload, grade, climate/A/C load from W5472).
Responsible (R): Dispatcher
Accountable (A): Dispatch Supervisor
Duration: per dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5477_Task6" name="Optimize payload/cube within the EV&#x27;s reduced-payload envelope; split/combine…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Optimize payload/cube within the EV&#x27;s reduced-payload envelope; split/combine orders or adjust replenishment frequency (VS-02) to maintain coverage.
Responsible (R): Dispatcher / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): Dispatch Supervisor
Duration: per dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5477_Task7" name="Plan any en-route/ opportunity charging stops (links W5474) into the schedule…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Plan any en-route/ opportunity charging stops (links W5474) into the schedule with dwell, and confirm charger availability at the stop.
Responsible (R): Dispatcher / Charging Ops
Accountable (A): Dispatch Supervisor
Duration: per dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5477_Task8" name="Pre-condition the cabin (while plugged in) to preserve range and confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Pre-condition the cabin (while plugged in) to preserve range and confirm SoC-at-departure meets the route requirement plus margin.
Responsible (R): Driver / Charging Ops
Accountable (A): Dispatch Supervisor
Duration: per dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5477_Task9" name="Define and trigger fallback coverage (diesel/hybrid vehicle or 3PL with green…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Define and trigger fallback coverage (diesel/hybrid vehicle or 3PL with green clause W5485) for EV-unavailable, range-insufficient, or peak-day events; track fallback-usage (W5488).
Responsible (R): Dispatcher / Fleet
Accountable (A): Dispatch Supervisor
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5477_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5477_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5477_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5477_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-807 (ensure controlled execution — EV / Alt-Fuel Fleet Operations, Charging &amp; Energy Management (PA-192.2).) | - operational: documented energy-buffer margin; fallback-usage ceiling and root-cause policy.
Owner: Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06.1/VS-06.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
