    <bpmn:process id="W_W5478" name="W5478. Alternative-Fuel (Biodiesel/B20, LNG, Hybrid) Operations &amp; Fuel Quality Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Alt-fuel vehicles/equipment in service; fuel procurement (VS-61)
Frequency: Per fuel-delivery; continuous quality/operations
Volume: Alt-fuel share of the fleet (biodiesel-blend drop-in for existing diesel; LNG/CNG for heavy line-haul where viable; hybrids)
Owner: Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager (VS-61)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Facilities/storage (VS-138/VS-24), Procurement (VS-03/VS-34), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W5478 — Alternative-Fuel (Biodiesel/B20, LNG, Hybrid) Operations &amp; Fuel Quality Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5478_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5478_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5478_Lane2" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5478_Lane3" name="Maintenance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5478_Lane4" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5478_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5478_Start6" name="Alt-fuel vehicles/equipment in service; fuel procurement (VS-61)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5478_Task7" name="Procure biodiesel/B20 (or higher blend) and LNG/CNG from accredited suppliers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procure biodiesel/B20 (or higher blend) and LNG/CNG from accredited suppliers (links VS-61/VS-34) with documented blend ratio, feedstock/RSB/ISCC sustainability, and quality spec.
Responsible (R): Procurement / Fuel Manager
Accountable (A): Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager
Duration: per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5478_Task8" name="Receive, store, and dispense alt-fuel compliantly (storage tanks, BFP Fire Code…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Receive, store, and dispense alt-fuel compliantly (storage tanks, BFP Fire Code for LNG/CNG, DENR where applicable — links VS-114); maintain fuel-quality testing (water, sediment, blend ratio, cetane) on receipt.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Fuel Manager
Accountable (A): Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager
Duration: per delivery</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5478_Task9" name="Monitor alt-fuel vehicle performance (fuel economy, cold-start, filter-clogging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor alt-fuel vehicle performance (fuel economy, cold-start, filter-clogging from biodiesel, component compatibility) and adjust maintenance intervals (VS-06.2) accordingly.
Responsible (R): Maintenance / Fleet
Accountable (A): Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5478_Task10" name="Track alt-fuel GHG reduction (lifecycle, vs diesel) for MRV (W5481) and ensure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Track alt-fuel GHG reduction (lifecycle, vs diesel) for MRV (W5481) and ensure sustainability-claim evidence (feedstock, certification) supports ESG disclosure (VS-25).
Responsible (R): ESG / Fuel Manager
Accountable (A): Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5478_Task11" name="Manage alt-fuel supply continuity (single-supplier risk, blend availability by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Manage alt-fuel supply continuity (single-supplier risk, blend availability by region) and a diesel-fallback for supply interruption.
Responsible (R): Procurement / Fuel Manager
Accountable (A): Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5478_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5478_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5478_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5478_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-807 (ensure controlled execution — EV / Alt-Fuel Fleet Operations, Charging &amp; Energy Management (PA-192.2).) | - operational: fuel-supplier TPRM/accreditation; BFP/DENR storage compliance; fuel-quality and sustainability-claim evidence; receipt quality-test mandatory before dispensing.
Owner: Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager (VS-61)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
