    <bpmn:process id="W_W5479" name="W5479. Charging–Renewable Integration, Demand Response &amp; On-Site Solar Load Matching" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Charging load established (W5473); solar generation (VS-108); tariff/DR signals
Frequency: Continuous optimization; seasonal review
Volume: Per charging site with co-located solar (VS-108)
Owner: Facilities &amp; Energy Manager (VS-138/VS-120)
Participants: Solar O&amp;M (VS-108), Fleet Charging Ops (W5473), Distribution Utility / Retail Electricity Supplier (VS-120), ESG (VS-25)
Source: workflow W5479 — Charging–Renewable Integration, Demand Response &amp; On-Site Solar Load Matching</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5479_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5479_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5479_Lane2" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5479_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5479_Start4" name="Charging load established (W5473); solar generation (VS-108); tariff/DR signals">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5479_Task5" name="Integrate the charging schedule (W5473) with the on-site solar generation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integrate the charging schedule (W5473) with the on-site solar generation forecast (VS-108) and battery-storage dispatch to maximize self-consumption of renewable generation for fleet charging.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Solar O&amp;M
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5479_Task6" name="Shape charging load to off-peak/low-tariff hours and avoid peak-demand bands…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Shape charging load to off-peak/low-tariff hours and avoid peak-demand bands (RCOA/WESM tariff exposure per VS-120); participate in any utility demand-response (DR) program where economics support it.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Energy Analyst
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5479_Task7" name="Track and verify the renewable-share of fleet charging (kWh-renewable /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track and verify the renewable-share of fleet charging (kWh-renewable / kWh-charged) to support a credible &quot;renewable-charged fleet&quot; ESG claim (VS-25) and avoid double-counting against the REC accounting (VS-108 W3465).
Responsible (R): ESG / Energy Analyst
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5479_Task8" name="Coordinate battery-storage dispatch (charge from solar surplus, discharge to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Coordinate battery-storage dispatch (charge from solar surplus, discharge to cover charging peak) and manage battery cycle-life economics.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Solar O&amp;M
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5479_Task9" name="Review the solar-charging match seasonally (monsoon/cloudy-season generation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Review the solar-charging match seasonally (monsoon/cloudy-season generation shortfall) and define the grid-supplement/fallback plan to maintain charging continuity.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Energy Analyst
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5479_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5479_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5479_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5479_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-807 (ensure controlled execution — EV / Alt-Fuel Fleet Operations, Charging &amp; Energy Management (PA-192.2).) | - operational: documented REC retirement-vs-sale policy; conservative &quot;renewable-charged&quot; claim threshold.
Owner: Facilities &amp; Energy Manager (VS-138/VS-120)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5479_Assoc12" sourceRef="W5479_Annotation11" targetRef="W5479_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow13" sourceRef="W5479_Start4" targetRef="W5479_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow14" sourceRef="W5479_Task5" targetRef="W5479_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow15" sourceRef="W5479_Task6" targetRef="W5479_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow16" sourceRef="W5479_Task7" targetRef="W5479_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow17" sourceRef="W5479_Task8" targetRef="W5479_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5479_Flow18" sourceRef="W5479_Task9" targetRef="W5479_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
